00:22:31.676 --> 00:22:32.676
Oh ohoh

00:22:33.716 --> 00:22:34.876
Oh ohoh

00:22:35.196 --> 00:22:36.196
Oh ohoh

00:22:39.836 --> 00:22:41.316
Oh ohoh

00:22:44.836 --> 00:22:46.996
